    Behavior
    -------
    Instances act as a Domain representing rational functions and provide
    conversion hooks between a variety of mathematical representations:
    SymPy expressions, polynomial rings, and other fraction-field objects.
    Common helpers include ``from_sympy``, ``to_sympy``, ``from_PolynomialRing``,
    and ``from_FractionField``. Many of these converters return ``None`` when
    coercion is not possible; some lower-level conversions may raise
    :class:`CoercionFailed` or :class:`GeneratorsError`.

